''This article is about Ash's main and temporary traveling companions. If you were looking for a general list of people Ash has met on his journey, see [[Character of the day]].''
----
[[File:Ash and friends JN OP 5.png|300px|thumb|Photographs of {{Ash}} and all of his friends]]
'''Ash's friends''' are the traveling companions that [[Ash Ketchum]] has had with him on his quest to become a [[Pokémon Master]]. While he started his {{pkmn|journey}} alone, many people have joined his party while touring the [[Pokémon world]]; usually, at least one new companion joins—and another leaves—every time a new [[series]] begins.

Throughout their journey together, Ash and his friends will sometimes be accompanied by temporary companions, who travel with the group for a few episodes without officially joining the main cast. Likewise, Ash also reunites with his previous friends on occasion, who often temporarily rejoin him before parting ways with him again.

In {{aniseries|SM}}, Ash's friends are not traveling companions, but rather classmates, since Ash is attending the [[Pokémon School]] instead of traveling around the [[Alola]] region. Later in the series, Ash and his Alolan friends form a team under the supervision of [[Aether Foundation]], known as the [[Ultra Guardians]].

