===Tracey Sketchit===
[[File:TraceyEP.png|thumb|170px|{{Tracey}}]]
{{main|Tracey Sketchit}}
After {{an|Brock}} left to work for Professor Ivy, Ash's traveling group was down to two, as it had been for the first five episodes of [[Kanto]]. However, this would not last very long, as in ''[[EP084|The Lost Lapras]]'' Ash met a [[Pokémon Watcher]] named {{Tracey}} who essentially invited himself along for the rest of the [[Orange Islands]] saga. Traveling with Ash, he wished to attain his ultimate goal of meeting {{an|Professor Oak}}, which he did when Ash returned to Kanto in ''[[EP115|A Tent Situation]]''. After this, he remained in [[Pallet Town]] to be Professor Oak's assistant in ''[[EP116|The Rivalry Revival]]''. Ash has reunited with Tracey during his visits to Pallet Town in ''[[EP273|Gotta Catch Ya Later!]]'', ''[[AG133|The Right Place and the Right Mime]]'', ''[[AG192|Home is Where the Start Is!]]'', and ''[[JN147|The Rainbow and the Pokémon Master!]]''.

