==''[[Pokémon the Series: Diamond and Pearl]]''==
===Dawn===
[[File:Dawn JN.png|thumb|150px|{{an|Dawn}}]]
{{main|Dawn (anime)}}
Like his journey into [[Hoenn]], Ash ventured to [[Sinnoh]] alone, where, in ''[[DP003|When Pokémon Worlds Collide!]]'', he would meet {{an|Dawn}}, the daughter of a [[Top Coordinator]] wishing to follow in the footsteps of [[Johanna|her mother]]. From that point, after saving [[Ash's Pikachu]] and having her bike fried in a similar way to May's and Misty's, Dawn would travel with Ash and Brock through Sinnoh, which she did until ''[[DP191|Memories are Made of Bliss!]]'' when all three friends split up.

Dawn rejoins Ash's group in ''[[Pokémon the Series: Black & White]]'' in ''[[BW086|Piplup, Pansage, and a Meeting of the Times!]]'' to compete in the [[Pokémon World Tournament Junior Cup]]. Dawn would leave the group in ''[[BW093|Goodbye, Junior Cup - Hello Adventure!]]'' and travel to Johto to compete in the [[Wallace Cup]]. 

Having returned from her journey in Johto and around the world, she met up with Ash again in ''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series]]'' during his research travel in Sinnoh with [[Goh]] to investigate {{p|Darkrai}} and {{p|Cresselia}} in ''[[JN074|Nightfall? Nightmares!]]'' and ''[[JN075|A Midsummer Night's Light!]]'', also meeting [[Chloe]] before meeting them. She met up with them again in ''[[JN089|The Gates of Warp!]]'' and ''[[JN090|Showdown at the Gates of Warp!]]'', helping to solve a crisis involving {{p|Dialga}} and {{p|Palkia}}. She reunited with Ash and Goh in ''[[JNS01|The Arceus Chronicles (Part 1]]'' through ''[[JNS04|4)]]'', and reunited with Ash and Chloe from ''[[JN129|A Flood of Torrential Gains!]]'' to ''[[JN132|Partners in Time!]]''.

