[[File:Iris JN.png|thumb|200px|right|{{an|Iris}}]]
{{main|Iris (anime)}}

Iris is said to be a wild girl, as proven by the fact that she swings on vines. She decided to travel throughout [[Unova]] and the [[Decolore Islands]] with Ash from ''[[BW002|Enter Iris and Axew!]]'' until ''[[BW141|Best Wishes Until We Meet Again!]]''

Her goal is to become a Dragon Master. She left the group in order to travel to [[Blackthorn City]] in the [[Johto]] region and challenge [[Clair]], to gain more experience towards her goal. Iris returned in ''[[JN065|Thrash of the Titans!]]'', where it was revealed she had unseated [[Alder]] to become the {{pkmn|Champion}} of the [[Unova League]]. She returned to participate in the [[World Coronation Series|Pokémon World Coronation Series]] [[Masters Eight Tournament]] from ''[[JN115|Curtain Up! Fight the Fights!]]'' to ''[[JN118|Battling as Hard as Stone!]]''.

