Kiawe is one of Ash's classmates. He is very gruff compared to his classmates and makes deliveries between islands on his {{p|Charizard}}. Ash first spotted Kiawe flying on his Charizard when he was lost in a forest. They formally met while Kiawe was in a battle with [[Team Skull]] and Ash joined in, making Kiawe the last of Ash's classmates Ash would meet. Kiawe remained in Alola in ''[[SM146|Thank You, Alola! The Journey Continues!]]'' to resume his [[island challenge]], with the goal of becoming [[Akala Island]]'s next [[island kahuna]] and following in [[Kiawe's grandfather|his grandfather]]'s footsteps. Kiawe reunited with Ash in ''[[JN037|That New Old Gang of Mine!]]'', where he also met [[Goh]] for the first time. He returned again in ''[[JN112|Helping the Hometown Hero!]]''.

