===Lillie===
[[File:Lillie SM.png|thumb|125px|{{an|Lillie}}]]
{{main|Lillie (anime)}}
Lillie is one of Ash's classmates. Prior to ''[[SM008|Lillie's Egg-xhilarating Challenge!]]'', she was terrified of physically interacting with Pokémon, and tended to freeze up whenever one Pokémon entered her personal space. She was the second of Ash's classmates he would meet. She was watching a {{p|Tauros}} race between {{an|Lana}}, {{an|Mallow}} and {{an|Sophocles}} as Ash accidentally stumbled upon the racing track and spotted Lillie on the other side. They became classmates when Ash enrolled himself at the Pokémon School shortly thereafter.

Over the course of the series, Lillie adopted her [[List of characters' first Pokémon|first Pokémon]], [[Snowy]], overcame her fear of Pokémon, and reaffirmed her family bonds with her older brother {{an|Gladion}}, her estranged mother {{an|Lusamine}}, and learned more about her long-missing father, [[Mohn]]. In ''[[SM146|Thank You, Alola! The Journey Continues!]]'', Lillie left with her family on a journey in search of Mohn. She found her father in the [[Crown Tundra]] and reunited with Ash in ''[[JN111|The Homecoming Crown!]]'', while also meeting [[Goh]] and [[Chloe]] for the first time. Lillie returned home to Alola in the [[JN112|following episode]] with her family and friends.

