==''[[Pokémon Journeys: The Series]]''==
===Goh===
[[File:Goh JN.png|thumb|125px|[[Goh]]]]
{{main|Goh}}
Goh is a {{pkmn|Trainer}} who had a chance encounter with {{an|Mew}} when he was younger. His goal as a Trainer is to catch Mew, and his dream is to eventually catch every Pokémon in existence. Goh first met {{Ash}} in his [[hometown]] of [[Vermilion City]] in ''[[JN002|Legend? Go! Friends? Go!]]'', while he was pursuing a {{p|Lugia}} during a [[Raid Battle (GO)#In animation|Raid Battle]], despite owning no Pokémon at the time. The duo later became [[Professor Cerise]]'s research assistants. Goh later caught his [[List of characters' first Pokémon|first Pokémon]] and partner, {{TP|Goh|Scorbunny}}, in ''[[JN005|Mind-Boggling Dynamax!]]'' during his first excursion to the [[Galar]] region. Goh has temporarily separated from Ash in ''[[JN032|Time After Time!]]'', ''[[JN042|Sword and Shield, Slumbering Weald!]]'', ''[[JN113|Chasing to the Finish!]]'', and ''[[JN127|Just a Scone's Throw From Here!]]''. In ''[[JN071|Leaping Toward the Dream!]]'', Goh joined the [[Project Mew]] research team in the hopes of furthering his dream. In ''[[JN136|This Could be the Start of Something Big!]]'', Goh officially parted ways from Ash when he decided to tour different regions alone in order to become a stronger Trainer who can equal Mew.

