===Gladion===
[[File:Gladion anime.png|thumb|250px|{{an|Gladion}}]]
{{main|Gladion (anime)}}
Gladion is {{an|Lillie}}'s older brother, and Ash's rival in ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon]]''. In ''[[SM052|Revealing the Stuff of Legend!]]'', Gladion and Lillie reunited with Ash and the rest of Lillie's friends, and joined forces to rescue {{an|Lusamine}}, who had been abducted by a {{DL|Ultra Beasts (anime)|Nihilego}}.

In ''[[SM087|Filling the Light with Darkness!]]'', it was revealed that Gladion had joined the [[Ultra Guardians]] as its seventh member. Together with Ash and his classmates, they traveled to {{AP|Poipole}}'s home world in [[Ultra Space]], and were able to restore light to {{an|Necrozma}}.

