Shaymin is a [[wild Pokémon]] that {{an|Mallow}} cared for. It first appeared in ''[[SM108|Memories in the Mist!]]'', where it encountered Mallow after being drawn to her strong feelings of gratitude towards [[Mallow's mother|her late mother]]. Mallow then decided to take it in until the time came for it to turn into its {{DL|List of Pokémon with form differences|Shaymin|Sky Forme}} and fly away. In ''[[SM146|Thank You, Alola! The Journey Continues!]]'', Mallow's brother [[Ulu]] returned home, carrying flowers that turned out to be [[Gracidea]]s, which allowed Shaymin to change into its Sky Forme and fly away.

